1
00:00:02,010 --> 00:00:03,690
Previously on
The Big Bang Theory:

2
00:00:04,100 --> 00:00:06,550
Guess who I found at LAX.
My baby sister Priya.

3
00:00:06,550 --> 00:00:08,700
It's really nice
to see you again, Leonard.

4
00:00:08,700 --> 00:00:10,570
Yeah, it's good
to see you, too.

5
00:00:10,570 --> 00:00:11,640
Here you go.

6
00:00:11,640 --> 00:00:12,800
(Howard:)Thanks.

7
00:00:16,440 --> 00:00:17,850
You slept with
my sister?!

8
00:00:17,860 --> 00:00:19,110
(Howard:)Yeah.

9
00:00:19,110 --> 00:00:21,240
This is a terrible
betrayal of my trust!

10
00:00:21,240 --> 00:00:23,110
Would it help
if I told you

11
00:00:23,110 --> 00:00:24,780
that I offered
her my heart,

12
00:00:24,780 --> 00:00:26,610
and she kinda
stomped on it?!

13
00:00:26,610 --> 00:00:27,900
How hard did she stomp?

14
00:00:27,900 --> 00:00:29,120
Very hard.

15
00:00:29,120 --> 00:00:31,480
Okay, I'm good.

16
00:00:36,990 --> 00:00:38,690
(Howard:)What's so funny?

17
00:00:38,690 --> 00:00:40,930
(Bernadette:)Nothing. Just thinking

18
00:00:40,930 --> 00:00:44,360
(Bernadette:)about the noises people
make during sex.

19
00:00:44,370 --> 00:00:47,400
(Howard:)I do sometimes get a bit
carried away, don't I?

20
00:00:48,940 --> 00:00:50,390
(Bernadette:)It's cute.

21
00:00:50,390 --> 00:00:54,140
(Bernadette:)You sound a little
like a drunken monkey.

22
00:00:54,140 --> 00:00:56,980
(Bernadette:)Ooh-ooh-ooh-ooh!

23
00:00:59,010 --> 00:01:01,920
(Howard:)You know it's meant
as a compliment.

